    "chunk_text": "VII IDUS OCTOBR, PASSIO SANCTI DIONISII ET SOCIORUM EIUS. PAULUS, \u00d0EODA LAREOW, \u00fea \u00f0a he geond land ferde bodigende geleafan swa swa him bebead se \u00de\u00e6r w\u00e6s Dionisius, se deorwur\u00f0a martyr, \u00fe\u00e6ra h\u00e6\u00feena lareow on heora geleafleaste, o\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t Paulus hine Se Dyonisius geseah, mid sumum o\u00ferum u\u00f0witan, on egypta lande \u00fe\u00e6r hi \u00e6t lare w\u00e6ron, hu seo sunne \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 Dyonisius, \u00feeos deorce niht getacna\u00fe micel leoht towerd eallum middanearde \u00fe\u00e6t God sylf He w\u00e6s \u00fea iung mann, \u00fea \u00f0a \u00feis gewear\u00f0, and him com \u00fe\u00e6t leoht to, \u00feurh Paules lare sy\u00f0\u00f0an, swa swa Paulus eode \u00fea gleawlice and heora godas sceawode ealle be endebyrdnysse, and eac \u00fea weofoda, o\u00fe \u00dea bewende hine Paulus to Dionisie \u00feam Drihtnes men and cw\u00e6\u00f0, Hw\u00e6t is se uncu\u00f0a god \u00fee ge \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 Dyonisius, he is digle git mannum, and is towerd on worulde, and gewylt ealle \u00feing, heofonas \u00d0a andwyrde Paulus, hw\u00e6t \u00feinc\u00f0 eow be \u00feam gode, bi\u00fe he gast o\u00f0\u00f0e man? Dyonisius andwyrde \u00feam arwur\u00f0an Paule \u00feus, He bi\u00f0 so\u00f0lice God, and so\u00f0lice man, and he sylf \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 se halga Paulus, \u00feone God ic eow bodige \u00feone \u00f0e ge hata\u00f0 uncu\u00f0ne; he is acenned of Marian He astah eac to heofonum to his halgan f\u00e6der,",
